# "Sacrifices it at the beginning of the next cleanup step" is a delayed triggered ability (CR 603.7), created as Necromancy,
# cast in Bot2's main phase as though it had flash, becomes a permanent (CR 608.3g). It triggers as Bot2's cleanup step
# begins and goes on the stack after the cleanup's turn-based actions, and players get priority (CR 514.3a): Bot1 Stifles
# it there. Countered, it does nothing, and it triggers only once (CR 603.7b), so Necromancy and the Ornithopter it returned
# stay through the cleanup step that follows and into Bot1's turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Damn
Necromancy
Swamp
Mox Sapphire
Stifle
Swamp
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

